Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What city is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this not my own body?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Machines that can fly that freely through the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, in this world,\Nmechanical technology\Ndeveloped instead of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.94,0:01:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why there are machines here\Nthat we cannot comprehend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.45,0:01:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"This world"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:17.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you realize?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:19.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is the other side of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.06,0:01:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who obtain it are set free from the Law of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no need to pay a price\Nin order to obtain something, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:02:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We sought it and found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:54.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds like something has happened at the Central Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:56.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of confusion,\Nand I couldn't make out any details.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:03:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:01.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to hold out well enough against the ragtag soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that Major General Hakuro \Nhas scraped together, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And as long as the Colonel realizes his dream during that period, everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:12.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nwe've been fairly dumb, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.13,0:04:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We only vaguely know\Nwhat the Colonel is up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reinforcements!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:27.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this point, I'm not impersonating the Colonel anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:53.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was there something different that you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't tell your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:08.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on,\NI'll get you one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:13.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:16.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is your treasure in there, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:37.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was going to give it to you when you were a little more grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:43.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on to this\Nfor me until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:49.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm entrusting my life to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be sure to guard it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, Your Excellency!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:05:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The men outside said that\Nthey saw someone suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Hawkeye, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm honored that you remember me,\NYour Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Around the front!\NMove around to the front! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.99,0:06:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:50.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our friends are planning to stage a wholesale uprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:06:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-There was a communiqué...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Führer's residence...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Excellency,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.15,0:07:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This world is filled with death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've even used a gas that takes\Na great number of lives here in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the future, people will die\Neven more efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You saw it too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of those lives,\Nspanning past to future,\Nbecome the source of our alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The source?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you\Ntalking about? Alchemy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Equivalent exchange?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in order to return a broken radio\Nback to the way it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you need more than just\Nthe same amount of mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:00.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You also need the energy it takes to reconstruct it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You cannot have an equivalent exchange that ignores that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The lives of those who die in this world\Npass through the gate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and provide the energy for our alchemy. Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We all have a small gate, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemists open this gate,\Nand from there,\Nthey connect to this world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:24.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and exploit those lives\Nto obtain power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:27.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you {\i1}are{\i0} in league\Nwith that woman after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No such thing as\Nequivalent exchange, huh?!\NShe said the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've met Dante, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw the love letter you sent her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.27,0:08:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one from four hundred years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two have prolonged your lives by taking over other bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:47.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you marry Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you just want to see how fun it would be to have children like regular people do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:54.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I loved your mom—Trisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the first time\NI knew love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:14.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want you to see this decaying body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:23.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:27.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make him a complete Stone inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on, snap to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:36.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust... What happened to Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:39.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust! Lust!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?! Eat him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see his son \Ngurgling away inside of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:51.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I wanted to\Ntear the runt to pieces, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:09:59.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust... Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know it was sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gluttony?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now,\Nhe possesses nothing but his appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was originally going to be the homunculus I used to refine red water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need a mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:35.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante cannot create a\NPhilosopher's Stone by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:38.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I always\Nkept myself in hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But once I learned she had set her sights on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:45.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you sent through the gate by Dante too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante separated my soul, mind, and body within the gate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:52.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and probably thinks\NI am wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:56.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I was able to\Nget through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about this body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This world differs from ours on the point of the development of alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but is otherwise\Nalmost identical to ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why there's a child here who is identical to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:13.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's probably a boy out there\Nidentical to Al too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.17,0:11:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's why you were living next to this boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your body is still\Ninside the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:24.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your soul and mind must be all that were drawn over
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to dwell within\Nthis Edward's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:36.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General Churchill said he needed to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open the gate within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:50.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Find your own body\Nwithin the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're coming back too,\Naren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:54.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My body has already\Npassed through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.93,0:12:01.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot use alchemy in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:04.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's still time for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:05.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll come up with something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:13.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to die here,\Nin this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:16.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with the face and form\Nthat Trisha loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am relieved to know that\Nequivalent exchange is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't necessarily need to pay a price\Nin order to obtain something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When a parent loves their child, there can be no cost or reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, if I stick with it, \NI can still obtain something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:50.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone who makes an effort will be fairly rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:54.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you pay the price, you can acquire an equal happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:57.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of equivalent exchange I'd like to believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reality...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reality isn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So if you say it's a childish theory, then I'm fine with being a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to think that you could go unrewarded after paying a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:17.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a zeppelin coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Brigadier General Mustang?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:03.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be with you, at the northern front.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:05.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is an impostor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:08.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is in Central and is after the Führer's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:14.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could be a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:15.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This {\i1}is{\i0} an old house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just to be sure,\NI'll go have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys watch after my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:22.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In case anything happens,\Ntake them to the command center.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My family is more important to me than my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew you would come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this the first time\Nyou have betrayed my trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one\Nwho betrayed us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean my being a homunculus?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:17.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether or not you are human\Nis no great matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then does it even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since I have become Führer, I have eliminated other races through recurring wars
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:29.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and have continued to expand our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:33.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But all of it was so that you could create a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:40.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who have been made desperate by war \Nseek the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People are fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:46.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you have those foolish people\Nmake Philosopher's Stones, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:53.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then we take the Philosopher's Stones from you, saving you from ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:56.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could say that\Nwe are God's apostles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That may be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:02.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, there {\i1}are{\i0} devils:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:05.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you alchemists!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:17.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The explosive force of an open space\Ndoes not compare to that of a closed space.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.69,0:16:22.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though I'm sure that the great Flame Alchemist\Nwas already aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:27.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can see air currents!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.49,0:16:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how I realized that\Nthis cave had been closed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very soon, you will become me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't let him use alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.03,0:17:09.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(4540,4740,\c&HF8FAFB&,\3c&HF8FAFB&,\4c&HF8FAFB&)}Bring my...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:13.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring my mama back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Naughty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:27.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, the Philosopher's Stone\Nhas been activated to its maximum level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:30.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were to use alchemy here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:32.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the transmutation would be started,\Ndon't you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I let you live because\NI thought you were still of use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:49.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gate...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gate...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:54.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:06.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:10.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm back...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.68,0:18:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:20.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That other "me" over there died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've used yet another life\Nfrom the other side, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Edward-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.98,0:18:31.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doctor Marcoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:33.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know why, don't you?\NEd,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're the one who turned Doctor Marcoh \Nover to the Führer, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way\Nhe could be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.71,0:18:46.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's long since\Ngone into his stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's as though you were the one who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:53.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And while we're at it, \Nthat goes for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:57.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be difficult,\Nfighting the faces of those you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though you've convinced yourself\Nthat it's not the real person!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:09.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that the only power you've got?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If so, I've got you beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already defeated\Nmany other homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even defeated the one\Nwho looked like my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this point, no matter\Nwhose face you take on...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:26.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kill me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? Hard, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't do that, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.93,0:19:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got no right\Nto order me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Makes no difference to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there's no telling what will happen to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone has been activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If a transmutation were to occur around him, then I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:51.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you know what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:19:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get too full of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:09.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't, Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop messing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.93,0:20:19.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:22.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal! Are you trying to kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.89,0:20:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That face is the easiest one\Nfor me to hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me your real face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is using other people's faces\Nand taking advantage of others
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.23,0:20:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the only thing you can do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:41.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to see it that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show it to me, if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:45.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted to see it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.97,0:21:00.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy was the first homunculus, \Ncreated when Hohenheim was still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:11.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The boy that he had with me at the time\Ndied from mercury poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:15.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He tried to bring him back to life somehow, but he failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:20.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then he abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:24.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why I hate him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:41.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:02.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,850)}Ed!
